      "subject": "",
      "body": "Good afternoon,\n\nI\u2019m submitting a first notice of loss for Summit Ridge Construction Inc. under policy CPP-6612078 with Travelers Indemnity Company.\n\nReported loss details:\n- Date of loss: 07/15/2025\n- Time of loss: Approximately 2:20 PM\n- Location: 9400 E Arapahoe Rd, Centennial, CO 80112\n- Reported incident: A subcontractor vehicle backed into a client\u2019s parked SUV in the project staging area, causing rear bumper and liftgate damage. No reported bodily injury at this time.\n\nPlease open a claim and advise the claim number and any next steps. Derek Olsson is the primary contact for the insured and can be reached at (303) 555-0188 or dolsson@summitridgegc.com.\n\nThank you,\nFront Range Commercial Insurance\n\nNote: the policy number on the attachment may be off by a digit; the correct one ends in 9.",
